Like his heart, the God of Fire's soul took the physical form of a beautiful scarlet crystal called the Fire Soul. Some time later, the Fire Soul exploded and its fragments flew all over the continent, giving rise to the many volcanoes in our land.

God of Fire...
Trusted subordinates...
Kelvezu...
Flaming Lady...

It seems Kelvezu made that cave its lair to protect the passage that leads to the Heart of Fire.

Just a little more; I am almost done. Come back later.
